@startuml
title C16 performance, memory, and disclosure flows
' Traces: OMCT-C16-L2-05.01, OMCT-C16-L2-05.02, OMCT-C16-L2-05.03, OMCT-C16-L2-05.04, OMCT-C16-L2-05.05, OMCT-C16-L2-06.01, OMCT-C16-L2-06.02, OMCT-C16-L2-06.03
actor Operator
participant "Playwright runner" as Runner
participant "Production server" as ProdServer
participant "Development server" as DevServer
participant "Browser page" as Page
participant "AppLogoComponent" as AppLogo
participant "HttpBrandingGateway" as BrandingGateway
participant "Cupola.Api BrandingController" as BrandingController
participant "AboutDialogComponent" as AboutDialog
participant "Licenses plugin" as LicensesPlugin
participant "OverlayService" as OverlayService
participant "LicensesComponent" as LicensesComponent

Runner -> ProdServer: start production-mode server
activate ProdServer
ProdServer --> Runner: server ready
Runner -> Page: run non-contract performance tests
activate Page
Page --> Runner: performance results
Runner -> Page: open view and navigate away
Page --> Runner: garbage-collection verification result
Runner -> Page: change tabs and perform plot tagging
Page --> Runner: rendering and tagging results
deactivate Page
deactivate ProdServer

Runner -> DevServer: start development-mode server
activate DevServer
DevServer --> Runner: server ready
Runner -> Page: run contract performance specifications
activate Page
Page --> Runner: contract results
deactivate Page
deactivate DevServer

Operator -> AppLogo: activate about dialog
activate AppLogo
AppLogo -> BrandingGateway: getBuildInfo()
activate BrandingGateway
BrandingGateway -> BrandingController: GET /api/branding/build-info
activate BrandingController
BrandingController --> BrandingGateway: version, build date, revision, branch
deactivate BrandingController
BrandingGateway --> AppLogo: build information
deactivate BrandingGateway
AppLogo -> AboutDialog: render version and Apache-2.0 license information
activate AboutDialog
AboutDialog --> AppLogo: about content rendered
deactivate AboutDialog
AppLogo --> Operator: display about dialog
deactivate AppLogo

Operator -> LicensesPlugin: navigate to /licenses
activate LicensesPlugin
LicensesPlugin -> OverlayService: open full-screen nondismissible overlay
activate OverlayService
OverlayService -> LicensesComponent: render third-party licenses
activate LicensesComponent
LicensesComponent --> OverlayService: licenses rendered
deactivate LicensesComponent
OverlayService --> LicensesPlugin: overlay displayed
deactivate OverlayService
LicensesPlugin --> Operator: display license route
deactivate LicensesPlugin
@enduml
